# Pairs with InstalledEqualsReviewed. A second review must record the digest of what it reviewed, not the first
# review's digest.
MODULE: AppsReviewKeepsStalePin
TARGET: InstalledEqualsReviewed
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a review after the first keeps the first review's digest
PERTURBS: Review

--- FIND
    /\ pin' = Digest(source)
--- REPLACE
    /\ pin' = IF pin = "none" THEN Digest(source) ELSE pin
--- END
